Where?

00:27:11.109 --> 00:27:14.250
Over here.

00:27:14.250 --> 00:27:27.170
This is a lantern I brought from me in. I must have dropped it here.

00:27:27.170 --> 00:27:35.250
Something made you drop it?

00:27:35.250 --> 00:27:43.230
God.

00:27:43.230 --> 00:27:49.329
This is so not the weekend I had in mind.

00:27:49.329 --> 00:27:50.329
You were out here, Chloe.

00:27:50.329 --> 00:27:51.329
Do you think you could have...

00:27:51.329 --> 00:27:52.329
Gone Norman Bates?

