Wait a minute. I wasn't the only one out here.

00:27:57.890 --> 00:28:00.890
There was a face, like a phantom.

00:28:00.890 --> 00:28:02.890
What did it look like?

00:28:02.890 --> 00:28:04.890
Black, white, and weird all over?

00:28:04.890 --> 00:28:07.890
And since this is where my memory hits a roadblock,

00:28:07.890 --> 00:28:11.890
I'm guessing that spirit started driving this doom buggy.

00:28:11.890 --> 00:28:13.890
I must have been possessed.

00:28:13.890 --> 00:28:15.890
No, you obviously aren't now.

00:28:15.890 --> 00:28:17.890
But if that spirit is responsible for this murder,

00:28:17.890 --> 00:28:19.890
we need to find it before it kills again.

00:28:19.890 --> 00:28:31.329
I told Chloe to go walk in the woods anyway.

00:28:31.329 --> 00:28:33.329
Was it Hansel and Gretel, you suppose?

00:28:33.329 --> 00:28:34.329
It's not much farther.

00:28:34.329 --> 00:28:36.329
Well, I hope she left the trailer breadcrumbs,

00:28:36.329 --> 00:28:37.329
because if she didn't, we might.

00:28:37.329 --> 00:28:39.329
never find our way out of here.

00:28:39.329 --> 00:28:41.329
Oh, I'll be leaving these woods.

00:28:41.329 --> 00:28:47.680
But you won't.

00:28:47.680 --> 00:29:06.170
The legend of Chabon McDougal is just a ghost story.

00:29:06.170 --> 00:29:08.170
It's not real.

00:29:08.170 --> 00:29:10.170
You've got a confused co-ed in your living room,

00:29:10.170 --> 00:29:12.170
and a dead body in your yard.

00:29:12.170 --> 00:29:14.170
Now, we need to hear the rest of Chavon's story.

00:29:14.170 --> 00:29:18.170
You really think a century's old spirit has come back for revenge?

00:29:18.170 --> 00:29:20.170
We've seen weirder things.

00:29:20.170 --> 00:29:27.450
After Chabon was killed,

00:29:27.450 --> 00:29:31.450
her soul was sent to the underworld where she was given great powers.

00:29:31.450 --> 00:29:32.450
What kinds of things?

00:29:32.450 --> 00:29:33.450
powers.

00:29:33.450 --> 00:29:42.660
Uncommon strength and the ability to slay any man that hears her wail.

00:29:42.660 --> 00:29:46.660
Superstitious villagers also gave her a new name.

00:29:46.660 --> 00:29:48.660
Silver Banshee.

00:29:48.660 --> 00:29:52.660
Okay, the last time I checked, the underworld was still underground.

00:29:52.660 --> 00:29:55.660
So how is it that this whaling wonder has gotten topside?

00:29:55.660 --> 00:30:00.660
Legend tells of a portal through which her spirit could return to this world.

00:30:00.660 --> 00:30:03.660
I was said to be a relic created in Chavon's own image.

00:30:03.660 --> 00:30:06.660
But after several deaths in the village,

00:30:06.660 --> 00:30:09.660
Bevan feared that he would soon be Silver Banche's next victim.

00:30:09.660 --> 00:30:12.660
So he conducted an ancient Scottish ritual

00:30:12.660 --> 00:30:15.660
and covered the relic in Chavon's spilt blood,

00:30:15.660 --> 00:30:17.660
sealing the portal shut.

00:30:17.660 --> 00:30:19.660
A relic in her image?

00:30:19.660 --> 00:30:21.660
Like a statue, an engraving?

00:30:21.660 --> 00:30:22.660
Or a painting?

00:30:22.660 --> 00:30:33.299
There's another portrait painted under this one.

00:30:33.299 --> 00:30:38.059
Bevan didn't just use blood to paint over her sister's image.

00:30:38.059 --> 00:30:41.059
He used it to paint his own portrait over hers.

00:30:41.059 --> 00:30:43.059
And then Lois must have accidentally opened the portrait

00:30:43.059 --> 00:30:46.059
opened the portal when she scraped it.

00:30:46.059 --> 00:30:48.059
Chloe, you need to figure out how to close that portal.

00:30:48.059 --> 00:30:50.059
I'll find out who's Chauvinan happening next.

00:30:50.059 --> 00:31:26.730
I was denied vengeance, just as I was denied power.

00:31:26.730 --> 00:31:29.730
But now I shall have both.

00:31:29.730 --> 00:31:33.730
I'm all about the girl power, really, but I gotta be honest with you.

00:31:33.730 --> 00:31:35.730
I don't see you break into any glass.

00:31:35.730 --> 00:31:37.730
Ceilings with that hair.

00:31:37.730 --> 00:31:50.299
You know who I am.

00:31:50.299 --> 00:31:52.299
And I know your story.

00:31:52.299 --> 00:31:54.299
The killing men won't make up for what was done to you.

00:31:54.299 --> 00:31:55.299
what was done to you?

00:31:55.299 --> 00:31:57.299
Maybe not.

00:31:57.299 --> 00:32:00.299
But it does make me feel better.

00:32:00.299 --> 00:32:31.400
Okay.

00:32:31.400 --> 00:32:33.400
Tell me you found something.

00:32:33.400 --> 00:32:37.859
Have a Bevan's diary.

00:32:37.859 --> 00:32:39.859
I don't suppose you read Gaelic.

00:32:39.859 --> 00:32:44.859
I may not have believed all the ghost stories, but I'm still McDougal.

00:32:44.859 --> 00:32:50.859
We banished her soul with blood and flame, then burned her body so her spirit could not walk again.

00:32:50.859 --> 00:32:55.970
Burn her body, burn her blood.

00:32:55.970 --> 00:32:58.970
I think we close this portal with fire.

00:32:58.970 --> 00:33:53.700
Beautiful.

00:33:53.700 --> 00:34:00.670
Able to spy with me on an equal footing.

00:34:00.670 --> 00:34:05.000
Almost Kryptonian.

00:34:05.000 --> 00:34:08.000
How did you weaken me in the barn?

00:34:08.000 --> 00:34:13.489
You have your secrets?

00:34:13.489 --> 00:34:16.489
And I have mine.

00:34:16.489 --> 00:34:18.489
Now we're even.

00:34:18.489 --> 00:34:22.489
I waited a long time to savor the power of my Kryptonian birthright.

00:34:22.489 --> 00:34:25.489
And I will do anything it takes to protect her.

00:34:25.489 --> 00:34:26.489
You must know that.

00:34:26.489 --> 00:34:30.829
In case you haven't noticed, Zod.

00:34:30.829 --> 00:34:33.829
There are a few that can stop you.

00:34:33.829 --> 00:34:37.829
Which is why the information you have is so valuable.

00:34:37.829 --> 00:34:39.829
You talk like we're on different sides.

00:34:39.829 --> 00:34:43.829
You tell me. We are partners after all.

00:34:43.829 --> 00:34:46.829
