00:34:46.829 --> 00:34:51.619
They certainly come in useful,

00:34:51.619 --> 00:34:59.519
especially when it comes to keeping an ear and an eye out for my competition.

00:34:59.519 --> 00:35:01.519
If you're referring to Clark,

00:35:01.519 --> 00:35:07.119
you may have met your match, but he's not your competition.

00:35:07.119 --> 00:35:10.119
He's one of you.

00:35:10.119 --> 00:35:14.880
But he stands apart.

00:35:14.880 --> 00:35:17.880
Read your own newspaper tests.

00:35:17.880 --> 00:35:19.880
With the help of a certain lovely reporter,

00:35:19.880 --> 00:35:23.880
the blur has become humanity's new Messiah.

00:35:23.880 --> 00:35:26.880
Now, I may be able to fly,

00:35:26.880 --> 00:35:30.880
but the world would willingly follow him on foot.

00:35:30.880 --> 00:35:32.880
You're jealous.

00:35:32.880 --> 00:35:36.599
I want to know what gives him that power.

00:35:36.599 --> 00:35:42.730
To know what will take it away.

00:35:42.730 --> 00:35:48.159
Never tell me.

00:35:48.159 --> 00:36:11.590
Information.

00:36:11.590 --> 00:36:13.590
is also power.

00:36:13.590 --> 00:36:37.269
But you understand that better than anyone.

00:36:37.269 --> 00:36:47.719
Um, it's a spoon.

00:36:47.719 --> 00:36:55.199
Why you a spoon, one of those little people collect them.

00:36:55.199 --> 00:37:00.199
I thought about getting you, uh, some of those little decorative soaps.

