What about your loss?

00:38:38.929 --> 00:38:41.929
I'm sure that Lois didn't have to drag you into the woods,

00:38:41.929 --> 00:38:43.929
kicking and screaming.

00:38:43.929 --> 00:38:48.210
Uh, you know, that's...

00:38:48.210 --> 00:38:50.210
Funny thing about scars.

00:38:50.210 --> 00:38:52.650
Yeah.

00:38:52.650 --> 00:38:57.010
They're always there.

00:38:57.010 --> 00:38:58.010
It doesn't mean they haven't healed.

