They can be kind of cute, too.

00:39:06.190 --> 00:39:10.190
You have one in particular that I'm partial.

00:39:10.190 --> 00:39:27.070
As incredible as that R&R attempt was,

00:39:27.070 --> 00:39:30.570
I think we should skip the old B&Bs for a while.

00:39:30.570 --> 00:39:34.570
Lois, for our first weekend away together, it could have been worse.

00:39:34.570 --> 00:39:39.070
I was possessed by a 300-year-old Scottish banshee and I almost killed you, Clark.

00:39:39.070 --> 00:39:41.570
We did get to see the world's largest ball of yarn.

00:39:41.570 --> 00:39:43.570
That made the whole trip worth while.

00:39:43.570 --> 00:39:46.570
All thanks to my stellar sense of direction.

00:39:46.570 --> 00:39:55.179
This face of Clark without me, you'd still be lost.

00:39:55.179 --> 00:39:59.699
What?

00:39:59.699 --> 00:40:13.250
Oh, my cell phone.

00:40:13.250 --> 00:40:15.250
Just let it go to voicemail.

00:40:15.250 --> 00:40:17.250
Yeah, well, why don't you answer it, Lois?

00:40:17.250 --> 00:40:26.699
What if it's important?

00:40:26.699 --> 00:40:27.699
A little privacy, please?

00:40:27.699 --> 00:40:28.699
Just pretend I'm not here.

00:40:28.699 --> 00:40:33.829
Can't do that.

00:40:33.829 --> 00:40:40.159
I guess I'll just have to get used to sharing you with the world.

00:40:40.159 --> 00:40:45.820
Lois Lane, at your service?

00:40:45.820 --> 00:40:52.750
I was wondering, hoping that you'd call again.

00:40:52.750 --> 00:40:54.750
I need your help.

00:40:54.750 --> 00:40:55.750
Anything.

00:40:55.750 --> 00:40:58.750
I need you to get information on test, sir.

00:40:58.750 --> 00:41:01.750
Well, you've come to the right girl.

00:41:01.750 --> 00:41:04.750
Just give me the question, I'll find you an answer.

00:41:04.750 --> 00:41:07.750
No matter what it takes, I'll do it.

00:41:07.750 --> 00:41:09.750
I want to help.

00:41:09.750 --> 00:41:10.750
I will get you the information.

00:41:10.750 --> 00:41:14.349
I'll get you the information you need.

00:41:14.349 --> 00:41:15.349
But you can't tell anyone about it.

00:41:15.349 --> 00:41:23.340
Promise me you won't.

00:41:23.340 --> 00:41:24.340
I promise.

00:41:27.119 --> 00:41:28.119
I promise.

00:41:28.119 --> 00:41:30.119
I wouldn't ask Lois if it weren't a matter of life or death.

